                                <h1>How to help protect yourself from scams &amp; fraud
</h1>
                            
                            
                        
                        

                        <div>
                            <p>Learn how to better protect yourself from scams and fraud by spotting warning signs and taking action if you think you&#39;ve been scammed. </p>
<p>Been scammed? Call us straight away on 13 2221 or message us in the CommBank app.</p>

