            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   remove-bottom-padding">
                <div class="one-by-three-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>How to report a scam
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column one-by-three-columns">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <p>If you think you&#39;ve been scammed, message us in the CommBank app or call us on <a href="tel:132221">13 2221</a>. </p>
<p>If you&#39;re a business customer, <a data-tracker-locationid="report_call-131998" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;report_call-131998&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="tel:131998">call 13 1998</a> and select option 4. </p>
<p><a href="/support/security/how-to-report-a-scam.html">Learn how to report a scam</a></p>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
