    <div class="group-module">
    
        <div id="protectyourself">
            <div class="group">




    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   remove-bottom-padding">
                <div class="one-by-three-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>Stop. Check. Reject.
</h2>
                            <p><p>Three simple steps to help protect yourself from scams.</p>
</p>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column one-by-three-columns">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <ol class="large-disc"><li><b>Stop - could this be a scam?</b><br />
If a call, email, text or social media post seem off, stop and take a breath so you can think clearly. Scammers often pressure you to act immediately.<br />
<br />
</li><li><b>Check - verify before you act</b><br />
Contact the organisation via their official website or app.<br />
<br />
</li><li><b>Reject - take action to protect yourself</b><br />
If you’re unsure, hang up on the caller and block the number, or delete the email or message.<br />
</li></ol>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <p>If you’ve shared any personal or banking details, change your passwords immediately and <a href="https://www.commbank.com.au/support/messaging.html">message us in the CommBank app</a> or call <a href="tel:132221">13 2221</a>.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider" id="how-commbank-helps">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   ">
                <div class="header-two-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>CommBank security features
</h2>
                            <p><p><img src="/content/dam/commbank-assets/icons/commbank-safe-logo2.jpg" alt=""/> </p>
<p>Help protect yourself with our security features and tools designed to help you detect and prevent scams.</p>
</p>
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        
                        <div class="row two-column no-vertical-divider ">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item  image-bottom ">
                <div class="image-section">
                    
                    
                        <img class=" " src="https://assets.commbank.com.au/is/image/commbank/CNCB0460_CommBank-Safe-Uplift-Q2_FY26-Resizes_2000x1200-lifestyle-5?$W728_H696$&fit=crop" alt=" " aria-hidden="true"/>
                        
                    
                </div>
                
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <h3>Verify CommBank calls instantly</h3>
<p>Received a call from us? <a href="/support/security/callercheck.html" data-tracker-locationid="features_callercheck" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_callercheck&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CallerCheck</a> pops up as a security notification in your CommBank app so you know it&#39;s us.</p>
<h3>Extra checks for first-time payments</h3>
<p>Get alerts if a first-time payment looks unusual, thanks to <a href="/support/security/namecheck.html" data-tracker-locationid="features_namecheck" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_namecheck&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">NameCheck</a> and <a href="/support/security/confirmation-of-payee.html" data-tracker-locationid="features_confirmation-of-payee" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_confirmation-of-payee&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Confirmation of Payee</a>.</p>
<h3><p>Confirm your identity securely</p>
</h3>
<p><a href="/support/security/customercheck.html" data-tracker-locationid="features_customer-check" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_customer-check&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CustomerCheck</a> helps us securely confirm your identity through a notification in your CommBank app.</p>
<h3><p>Extra security when you log on</p>
</h3>
<p><a href="/digital-banking/netbank/multi-factor-authentication.html" data-tracker-locationid="features_multi-factor-authentication" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_multi-factor-authentication&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Multi-factor authentication</a> adds an additional layer of protection to help keep your banking secure.</p>
<h3><p>Simple, secure identity verification</p>
</h3>
<p>With your consent, <a href="/digital-banking/connect-id.html" style="	background-color: rgb(255,255,255);
	font-weight: normal;
" data-tracker-locationid="features_connect-id" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;features_connect-id&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">ConnectID®</a><span style="	font-weight: normal;
"> </span><a href="https://www.commbank.com.au/support/security.html#terms" style="	background-color: rgb(255,255,255);
	font-weight: normal;
"><sup>1</sup></a> lets you securely prove your identity with participating businesses using the CommBank app.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   remove-bottom-padding">
                <div class="header-one-column">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>Received an unexpected call or message from us?
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column ">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="key-points">
	
		<div class="key-points-module">
			<div class="article-key-points">
				<h3>We&#39;ll never ask you to:</h3>
<p>✘ Share your NetBank Client ID, NetCode or passwords</p>
<p>✘ Share your card details including your PIN, expiry date or CVC</p>
<p>✘ Withdraw cash, transfer money or buy gift cards</p>
<p>✘ Log on to your account using a link from an email or SMS</p>
<p>✘ Move money to a “safe” account</p>
<p>✘ Help us catch cyber criminals</p>
<p>✘ Share your screen or download remote access software</p>
<p> </p>
<h3><b>What to do:</b></h3>
<ul><li>Ask the caller to verify it&#39;s us by sending a <a href="/support/security/callercheck.html" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CallerCheck</a> security code to your CommBank app</li><li>Hang up and then contact us directly</li><li>Even if a message looks real, always use official details on our website or in the CommBank app</li><li><a href="/support/messaging.html">Message us</a> in the CommBank app or by calling <a href="tel:132221">13 2221</a> or if you are a business customer, call <a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="tel:131998">13 1998</a> and select option 4</li></ul>
<p>If you received a suspicious message and haven’t clicked on it, you can report it by sending a screenshot or copy to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#dcb4b3bda4faffeae8e7bfbebdf2bfb3b1f2bda9" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">hoax&#64;cba.com.au</a></p>

			</div>
		</div>
	


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


    
    
