                <div class="header-two-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2><h2>CommBank scam alert: September</h2>
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        
                        <div class="row two-column no-vertical-divider ">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    align-images">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <p>Stay informed about emerging scams and learn how to spot the warning signs.</p>
<h3>How to better spot an investment scam</h3>
<p>Investment scammers often promote opportunities through social media, messaging apps, online ads or unexpected phone calls. Some common warning signs include: </p>
<ul><li>Promises of high returns with little or no risk </li><li>Pressure to invest quickly before the opportunity disappears </li><li>Requests to transfer money to cryptocurrency platforms or unfamiliar accounts </li><li>Unsolicited investment offers through social media, messaging apps or online ads </li><li>Early returns or withdrawals designed to make the investment appear genuine</li></ul>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    <p><a aria-label="View trending scams" href="/support/security/latest-scams-and-security-alerts.html" class="button_secondary" data-tracker-locationid="scam_alert_sept-investment" data-tracker-type="button" data-tracker_ei="default_0_1" data-tracker-id="default_0_1">View trending scams</a>
                        
                    </p>
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


