                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <ul><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Arabic.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_arabic" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_arabic&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Arabic</a><br />
</li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Dari.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_dari" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_dari&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dari</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93English.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_english" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_english&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">English</a> &amp; <a data-tracker-locationid="pdf_easy_english_new" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_easy_english_new&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Scams_images_accessible.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Easy English</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_filipino&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams-filipino.pdf" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_filipino">Filipino</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Greek.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_greek" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_greek&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Greek</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Hindi.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_hindi" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_hindi&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hindi</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_indonesian&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams-Indonesian.pdf" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_indonesian">Indonesian</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_italian&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams-Italian.pdf" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_italian">Italian</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Korean.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_korean" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_korean&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Korean</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Nepali.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_nepali" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_nepali&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nepali</a></li></ul>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                            <li class="item">
                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <ul><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Persian.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_persian" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_persian&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Persian</a> </li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Punjabi.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_punjabi" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_punjabi&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Punjabi</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_russian&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams-Russian.pdf" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_russian">Russian</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Simplified-Chinese.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_simplified-chinese" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_simplified-chinese&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Simplified Chinese</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Spanish.pdf" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_spanish" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_spanish&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spanish</a> </li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Thai.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_thai" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_thai&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Thai</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Turkish.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_turkish" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_turkish&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Turkish</a></li><li><a href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/Important-information-for-customers-about-scams%E2%80%93Vietnamese.pdf" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="pdf_vietnamese" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;pdf_vietnamese&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vietnamese</a></li></ul>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                

            </div>

        </div>
        
            
        


        
    </div>
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column">
    <div class="column-module bottom-divider no-vertical-divider" id="protecting">
        <!-- variation classes: one-column, two-column, three-column, four-column -->
        <div class="column-combo standard-spacing one-column ">

            <!--header section can be conditionally hide under three/four column layout -->
            <div class="header-section">
                <h2>Here are some ways our technology &amp; security experts are working to help you stay safe
</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">

                
                
                    <ul class="item-section">
                        
                            <li class="item">
                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <ul><li>First-time or unusual payments may be held for up to 24 hours</li><li>You may need to confirm some transactions in the CommBank app or with a NetCode</li><li>When you report a scam, our cyber experts act fast to shut it down</li></ul>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                

            </div>

        </div>
        
            
        


        
    </div>
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column">
    <div class="column-module bottom-divider no-vertical-divider">
        <!-- variation classes: one-column, two-column, three-column, four-column -->
        <div class="column-combo standard-spacing one-column ">

            <!--header section can be conditionally hide under three/four column layout -->
            <div class="header-section">
                <h2><b>Sometimes we may reach out to confirm your details</b>
</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">

                
                
                    <ul class="item-section">
                        
                            <li class="item">
                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <p>There may be a time when we will reach out to you to confirm information on your account or your identity.</p>
<p>Having accurate and up-to-date details is part of our ‘<a href="/latest/know-your-customer.html" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;KYC&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" data-tracker-locationid="KYC">Know Your Customer (KYC) requirements</a>. It also helps us protect you from fraud, as we can contact you immediately if we detect any suspicious activity.</p>
<p>If you’re ever concerned whether the person you’re speaking to is legitimately from CommBank, you can use the <a></a><a href="/support/security/callercheck.html" data-tracker-locationid="callercheck2" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;callercheck2&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CallerCheck</a> feature in the CommBank app to verify your caller’s identity.</p>
<p>Regardless of whether the caller has been identified, we will never ask you to transfer funds, share your screen or reveal your passwords.</p>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                

            </div>

        </div>
        
            
        


        
    </div>
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column">
    <div class="column-module bottom-divider ">
        <!-- variation classes: one-column, two-column, three-column, four-column -->
        <div class="column-combo standard-spacing two-column ">

            <!--header section can be conditionally hide under three/four column layout -->
            <div class="header-section">
                <h2>Help &amp; information
</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="content-section">

                
                
                    <ul class="item-section">
                        
                            <li class="item">
                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <h3>Need help?</h3>
<ul><li><a href="/support/lost-stolen-or-damaged-card-support-page.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_lost-stolen-or-damaged-card" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_lost-stolen-or-damaged-card&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Report a card lost or stolen</a></li><li><a href="/support/disputing-a-transaction.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_report-suspicious-transaction" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_report-suspicious-transaction&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Report or dispute a suspicious transaction on your account</a></li><li><a href="/support/security/how-to-report-a-scam.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_report-a-scam" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_report-a-scam&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">How to report a scam</a></li><li><a href="/support.digital-banking.change-netbank-password.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_change-netbank-password" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_change-netbank-password&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">How to change your NetBank password</a></li><li><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6e06010f16484d585a550d0c0f400d0103400f1b" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_notify-hoax-msg&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" data-tracker-locationid="help_notify-hoax-msg">Notify us about a hoax message</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_report-scam-payment-to-cba-bw-account&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/personal/eform/report-scam-payment-to-commbank-bankwest-form.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_report-scam-payment-to-cba-bw-account">Report a scam payment sent to a CommBank or Bankwest account</a></li><li><a href="/support/report-opening-of-commbank-bankwest-account-faqs.html" data-tracker-locationid="help_report-opening-of-cba-bw-account-faqs" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;help_report-opening-of-cba-bw-account-faqs&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">To report an unauthorised account opening, call us on 13 2221 or visit a CommBank branch</a></li></ul>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                            <li class="item">
                                <div class="item-inner">
                                    
                                    <h3>More information</h3>
<ul><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/content/dam/commbank-assets/support/docs/scams-and-fraud-flyer.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scams targeting over 65s and retirees</a></li><li><a href="/support/security/vulnerability-disclosure-program.html?ei=VulnerabilityRespDisc" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Our Vulnerability Disclosure Program</a></li><li><a data-tracker-locationid="info_ACCC-LittleBlackBookOfScams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;info_ACCC-LittleBlackBookOfScams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="https://www.accc.gov.au/publications/the-little-black-book-of-scams" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ACCC’s ‘The little black book of scams’</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="https://www.cyber.gov.au/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Australian Cyber Security Centre</a></li><li>&#39;<a data-tracker-locationid="hacked" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;hacked&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="https://www.cyber.gov.au/have-you-been-hacked" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Have you been hacked?&#39; quiz</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_scamwatch&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="https://www.scamwatch.gov.au/" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="link_scamwatch" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scamwatch</a></li><li><a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_idcare&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="https://www.idcare.org/" target="_blank" data-tracker-locationid="link_idcare" rel="noopener noreferrer">IDCARE</a></li></ul>

                                    
                                    
                                    
                                </div>
                        
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                

            </div>

        </div>
        
            
        


        
    </div>
</div>


</div>
            
        </div>
    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="accordion-container accordion panelcontainer">
    
        <div id="faqs" class="cmp-accordion " data-cmp-is="accordion" data-placeholder-text="false">
            <div class="standard-spacing bottom-divider column-combo two-column">
                <div class="header-section">
                    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
                    <p class="description"></p>
                </div>
                <div class="content-section">
                    <div class="accordion-section accordion-margin">
                        <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-are-the-most-common-scams-affecting-Australians-right-now?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What are the most common scams affecting Australians right now?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-da86ccd00d-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-da86ccd00d-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Common scams include:</p>
<ul><li><a></a>Impersonation scams</li><li><a href="/support/security/sms-phishing-scams.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_phishing-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_phishing-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Phishing scams</a></li><li><a href="/support/security/investment-scams.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_investment-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_investment-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Investment scams</a></li><li><a href="/support/security/online-shopping-scams.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_online-shopping-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_online-shopping-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Online shopping scams</a></li><li><a href="/business/security/scams/business-email-compromise.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_invoice-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_invoice-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Invoice scams</a></li><li><a href="/support/security/remote-access-scams.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_remote-access-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_remote-access-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Remote access scams</a></li></ul>
<p>Scammers often pretend to be from banks, government agencies, technology companies or trusted businesses. They may try to get you to share personal information, give access to a device or send money. Scam tactics change regularly, so it&#39;s important to know some of the latest warning signs.</p>
<p><a data-tracker-locationid="faqs_latest-scams" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_latest-scams&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/support/security/latest-scams-and-security-alerts.html">Stay aware of the latest scams</a></p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-should-I-do-if-I-accidentally-shared-my-banking-details?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What should I do if I accidentally shared my banking details?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-fa174e5c8f-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-fa174e5c8f-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>If you&#39;ve shared your banking details, <a href="https://mobile-app-redirect.commbank.com.au/support/messaging?jumpId&#61;jump_selfserviceservicewebsitecommbank_helpwithhoaxorscam&amp;entryPoint&#61;websitecommbank" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_shared-banking-details_message_us" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_shared-banking-details_message_us&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">message us in the CommBank app at any time</a> or call 13 2221.</p>
<p>Change any affected passwords or PINs, review recent transactions and stay alert for follow-up contact from scammers claiming to be from a bank, government agency or technology provider. </p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-should-I-do-if-I-think-I&#39;ve-been-scammed?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What should I do if I think I&#39;ve been scammed?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-a31345b610-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-a31345b610-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>If you think you&#39;ve been scammed, stop communicating with the suspected scammer and don&#39;t send any more money or personal information. If your accounts or cards may be affected, <a href="https://mobile-app-redirect.commbank.com.au/support/messaging?jumpId&#61;jump_selfserviceservicewebsitecommbank_helpwithhoaxorscam&amp;entryPoint&#61;websitecommbank" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_think-ive-been-scammed-message_us" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_think-ive-been-scammed-message_us&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">message us in the CommBank app</a> at any time, or call 13 2221. We&#39;ll explain the next steps and help secure your banking where possible.</p>
<p>In the meantime, you can change any passwords that may have been compromised and monitor your accounts for unusual activity. </p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-is-phishing-and-how-does-it-work?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What is phishing and how does it work?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-8803778036-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-8803778036-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Phishing is a scam where a person pretends to be a trusted organisation to trick you into sharing personal information, passwords, PINs, security codes or other bank details.</p>
<p>Phishing attempts can arrive through emails, text messages or social media messages. The goal is often to steal information, access accounts or convince people to make payments. Knowing the warning signs can help reduce the risk of scams, fraud and identity theft.</p>
<p><a href="/support/security/sms-phishing-scams.html" data-tracker-locationid="faqs_phishing" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_phishing&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Learn more about phishing</a></p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="How-can-I-tell-if-a-text-message-claiming-to-be-from-CommBank-is-genuine?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    How can I tell if a text message claiming to be from CommBank is genuine?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-9eda6707c1-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-9eda6707c1-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>The safest way to verify a text message is to contact CommBank using a trusted channel, rather than by replying to the message or using its links. Open the CommBank app and message us, or call 13 2221.</p>
<p>Warning signs that a text message may be a scam include:</p>
<ul><li>Pressure to act urgently</li><li>Links asking you to log on or verify your account</li><li>Requests for personal information, passwords or PINs</li><li>Requests to transfer money or make a payment</li></ul>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="How-do-I-know-if-a-payment-request-is-legitimate?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    How do I know if a payment request is legitimate?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-8752e8f0ea-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-8752e8f0ea-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Before sending money, verify that the payment request is genuine. Scammers often create a sense of urgency and may pretend to be a business, government agency, bank, family member or supplier to pressure you into acting quickly.</p>
<p>To help protect yourself:</p>
<ul><li>Stop and think before making a payment, especially if you&#39;re being rushed.</li><li>Contact the person or organisation using a trusted phone number (such as from their official website or app) or through a legitimate contact method you&#39;ve used before.</li><li>Double-check account details with the legitimate person or organisation if you&#39;ve been asked to pay a new bank account or update existing payment information.</li><li>Be cautious of requests received by text message, email or social media, particularly if they contain links or unexpected instructions.</li><li>If something doesn&#39;t feel right, take extra time to verify the request before sending money.</li></ul>
<p>Remember, once money is sent, it can be difficult, or even impossible, to recover. Taking a few minutes to independently verify a payment request could help protect you from scams and fraud.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="How-do-I-report-a-scam-to-CommBank?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    How do I report a scam to CommBank?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-6615c88049-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-6615c88049-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p><a href="https://mobile-app-redirect.commbank.com.au/support/messaging?jumpId&#61;jump_selfserviceservicewebsitecommbank_helpwithhoaxorscam&amp;entryPoint&#61;websitecommbank">Report a scam in the CommBank app 24/7</a> or call us on 13 2221.</p>
<p>If you&#39;ve received a suspicious email or text message claiming to be from CommBank, don&#39;t click any links or reply to the sender. Reporting scams helps us investigate suspicious activity and warn other customers.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-is-behavioural-information-and-how-does-CommBank-use-it-to-help-protect-customers?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What is behavioural information and how does CommBank use it to help protect customers?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-5ebd2519c2-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-5ebd2519c2-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Behavioural information is data about how a person typically uses and interacts with their device. This can include patterns in how they move, behave or navigate while using it. </p>
<p>We use this information to better understand a customer&#39;s usual device activity. If activity appears unusual or doesn&#39;t match these patterns, it may indicate that an account has been compromised or that a device is being used without the customer&#39;s authorisation. </p>
<p><a data-tracker-locationid="faqs_behavioural-information" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;faqs_behavioural-information&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="/support/security/behavioural-information.html">Learn more about how we use behavioural information</a> </p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="Can-CommBank-help-if-I&#39;ve-already-sent-money-to-a-scammer?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    Can CommBank help if I&#39;ve already sent money to a scammer?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-a711df1db6-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-a711df1db6-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Yes. <a href="https://mobile-app-redirect.commbank.com.au/support/messaging?jumpId&#61;jump_selfserviceservicewebsitecommbank_helpwithhoaxorscam&amp;entryPoint&#61;websitecommbank">Message us in the CommBank app</a> or call 13 2221 immediately if you&#39;ve sent money to a scammer.</p>
<p>We can&#39;t guarantee that funds sent to a scammer can be recovered, but reporting the scam as soon as possible may help us investigate the payment and take appropriate action. We&#39;ll also help secure your accounts and explain what to do next.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="How-can-I-tell-if-an-email-is-a-scam?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    How can I tell if an email is a scam?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-78893dc73f-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-78893dc73f-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Scam emails often:</p>
<ul><li>Create a sense of urgency</li><li>Ask for personal or banking information</li><li>Encourage you to click a link</li><li>Ask you to open an attachment</li></ul>
<p>Be cautious of unexpected emails, unusual sender addresses, spelling mistakes or requests that seem out of character. If you&#39;re unsure whether an email is legitimate, don&#39;t click any links. Instead, go directly to the organisation&#39;s official website or use a trusted contact method to verify the request.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="Why-do-people-fall-for-scams?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    Why do people fall for scams?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-060626113f-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-060626113f-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>Anyone can be targeted by a scam. Scammers rely on psychology, often creating urgency, fear, excitement or trust to influence your decision making. Often, the most effective protection is taking time to stop, think and verify before acting.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
                            <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
                                <button class="cmp-accordion__button accordion-header accordion-header--clickable" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button" data-tracker-locationid="What-should-I-do-if-someone-is-pressuring-me-to-act-quickly?" type="button" data-tracker-type="button">
                                    What should I do if someone is pressuring me to act quickly?
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-close hc-icon-arrow-up">
                                    </span>
                                    <span class="icon-wrapper chevron-open icon-arrow-down">
                                    </span>
                                </button>
                            </h3>
                            <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-container-561902495e-item-319c187eb8-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-container-561902495e-item-319c187eb8-button"><div class="accordion-item">
	 
		<div>
			<p>If someone is pressuring you to make a payment, share personal information or act immediately, take a step back before responding. Creating a sense of urgency is a common tactic used by scammers to stop people from thinking clearly or verifying a request.</p>
<p>Before taking any action, independently verify the request using a trusted phone number, website or contact method. If you&#39;re unsure, stop, check and reject.</p>

			
			
		</div>
	


    
</div>
</div>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </div>
    
</div>


</div>
        
    </div>

